			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Guys, focus, we have a mission to complete."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729102.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Speaking of, can you remind me what I'm doing here again?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "We need to go to the Facility to get some answers about O.B.L.I.V.I.O.N and see what they are up to..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "However, we have to escape this Assembly Plant and go through the Sewers in order to get there."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729102.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Ok then, lets go..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "It isn't that simple, Alex... there is a massive Bee Robot we have to deal with that is gaurding the exit door..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "However, it should be vulnerable to your stun gun!"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1784729720.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_010",
			"options": [

			],
			"portrait": "",
			"question": "Do you know how to use your Stun Gun?"
		},
		{
			"choice": "Yes",
			"condition": "",
			"definition": "",
